    },
    {
      "zh-CN": "木筏正上方不能倒，在它两边倒；油比木头重，也能托起它。",
      "en": "You cannot pour right above the raft, so pour on both sides of it; oil is heavier than wood and lifts it too."
    },
    {
      "zh-CN": "在木筏左右各画一道三格粗的短横线，一共八十格左右，水位正好升到闸墙下面。",
      "en": "Draw a short three-cell-thick line on each side of the raft, about 80 cells in all, which brings the level just below the top of the wall."
